ol villages were treated. The data is the actual data collected to evaluate the impact of the Progresa program. In this file, each row corresponds to an observation taken for a given child for a given year. There are two years of data (1997 and 1998), and just under 40,000 children who are surveyed in each year.","topics":[],"score":189055,"global_rank":366112},{"name":"enesdilber/Project_Pokemon2","owner":"enesdilber","html_url":"https://github.com/enesdilber/Project_Pokemon2","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Deep Learning for Pok\u00e9mon","topics":[],"score":189047,"global_rank":366198},{"name":"SaloniDash7/MachineLearning-Algorithms","owner":"SaloniDash7","html_url":"https://github.com/SaloniDash7/MachineLearning-Algorithms","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Vanilla implementation of generic Machine Learning algorithms","topics":[],"score":189039,"global_rank":366249},{"name":"RashmikaReddy/sentence--segmentation","owner":"RashmikaReddy","html_url":"https://github.com/RashmikaReddy/sentence--segmentation","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":189023,"global_rank":366384},{"name":"mborysiak/Factors-Affecting-Teen-Pregnancy-Rate","owner":"mborysiak","html_url":"https://github.com/mborysiak/Factors-Affecting-Teen-Pregnancy-Rate","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":189014,"global_rank":366427},{"name":"sagecodes/DataScience101","owner":"sagecodes","html_url":"https://github.com/sagecodes/DataScience101","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":188998,"global_rank":366615},{"name":"shravan097/PythonMLPractice","owner":"shravan097","html_url":"https://github.com/shravan097/PythonMLPractice","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"lang